{%- comment -%}
  theinmag-video-hub  (2026-10-20, Webster; round 3 same day)
  First section of /pages/videos, the grown-ups' video hub.

  Round 4 (Ryan): the split hero felt half-finished, so the hero is
  FULL-BLEED media with the copy over a scrim.
    1. HERO MEDIA. A muted, looping, playsinline background video
       (video_url, Shopify Files mp4) over a poster image (the whiteboard
       still until Quentin's loop arrives). Phones get video_mobile_url
       if set, otherwise the poster only. prefers-reduced-motion never
       loads the video. The poster is the LCP image; the video fades in
       on "playing". object-fit cover, never stretched.
  Round 3 notes still apply:
    2. H1 "Plan IN tasks with us" (IN in the brand .theinmag-in style),
       with a Subscribe button beside it: the official YouTube play mark
       (red #FF0000, white triangle, unaltered) on an inky pill, our own
       type, so it reads YouTube without copying YouTube's UI.
    3. Jump links to the two show chapters.
    4. SEARCH just under the hero. Results render directly under the
       input as you type: a short list of links built from a JSON copy
       of the video registry (title, series, area, length, 40+ keywords).
       Scored match, stopwords ignored, so parent phrasing ("how do I get
       my kid to calm down") still lands.
    5. JOIN POP-IN. A small card that slides in from the left after 12 s
       or 40% scroll, once per visitor (localStorage, try/catch). Not a
       modal: no focus trap, no scrim, focus is not stolen; Escape and the
       close button dismiss it, and focus returns to where it was if it
       was inside. Two-sentence note from Ryan, signature in Post (or
       RyanHand if the setting is switched), one action: the free email
       signup at /pages/newsletter. Never promises features that do not
       exist yet. prefers-reduced-motion users get it without the slide.

  Schema: BreadcrumbList + CollectionPage whose ItemList points at each
  LIVE watch page.

  Future-proofing: the hub is a plain page at /pages/videos. A later
  members' area can sit beside it without moving a public URL.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  capture vdata
    render 'theinmag-videos-data'
  endcapture
  assign records = vdata | strip | split: '@@'
  assign now_num = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0
  assign hero_src = section.settings.image_filename | default: 'videos-hero-ryan-whiteboard.jpg' | asset_url
  assign h1 = section.settings.heading | default: 'Plan IN tasks with us' | replace: ' IN ', ' <span class="theinmag-in">IN</span> '
-%}

<section class="theinmag-video-hub" aria-labelledby="theinmag-video-hub-h1">
  <div class="theinmag-video-hub__hero">
    <div class="theinmag-video-hub__media">
      <img
        class="theinmag-video-hub__image"
        src="{{ hero_src }}"
        width="1012" height="1800"
        fetchpriority="high"
        style="object-position: {{ section.settings.poster_focus | default: '50% 22%' }};"
        alt="{{ section.settings.image_alt | escape }}"
      >
      {%- if section.settings.video_url != blank -%}
        <video
          class="theinmag-video-hub__bgvideo"
          muted loop playsinline preload="none"
          aria-hidden="true"
          data-hero-video
          data-src="{{ section.settings.video_url }}"
          {% if section.settings.video_mobile_url != blank %}data-src-mobile="{{ section.settings.video_mobile_url }}"{% endif %}
        ></video>
      {%- endif -%}
      <span class="theinmag-video-hub__scrim" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
    {%- if section.settings.video_url != blank -%}
      <button type="button" class="theinmag-video-hub__pause" data-hero-pause aria-pressed="false" hidden>
        <span data-hero-pause-label>Pause background video</span>
      </button>
    {%- endif -%}
    <div class="theinmag-video-hub__copy">
      <p class="theinmag-video-hub__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</p>
      <div class="theinmag-video-hub__titlerow">
        <h1 id="theinmag-video-hub-h1" class="theinmag-video-hub__heading">{{ h1 }}</h1>
        {%- if section.settings.subscribe_url != blank -%}
          <a class="theinmag-video-hub__sub" href="{{ section.settings.subscribe_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg class="theinmag-video-hub__sub-mark" viewBox="0 0 28 20" width="28" height="20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect width="28" height="20" rx="5" fill="#FF0000"/><path d="M11.2 5.7v8.6l7.4-4.3z" fill="#FFFFFF"/></svg>
            <span>{{ section.settings.subscribe_label | default: 'Subscribe' }}</span>
            <span class="visually-hidden"> on YouTube (opens in a new tab)</span>
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <p class="theinmag-video-hub__line">{{ section.settings.hero_line }}</p>
      <nav class="theinmag-video-hub__jumps" aria-label="Jump to a series">
        {%- if section.settings.jump_1_label != blank -%}
          <a class="theinmag-btn theinmag-btn--secondary-on-image" href="{{ section.settings.jump_1_url }}">{{ section.settings.jump_1_label }}</a>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.jump_2_label != blank -%}
          <a class="theinmag-btn theinmag-btn--secondary-on-image" href="{{ section.settings.jump_2_url }}">{{ section.settings.jump_2_label }}</a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- liquid
    assign start_rec = ''
    for rec in records
      assign sf = rec | split: '^^'
      if sf[2] == 'start' and sf[1] != blank
        assign start_rec = rec
        break
      endif
    endfor
  -%}
  {%- if start_rec != blank -%}
    {%- assign sf = start_rec | split: '^^' -%}
    <div class="theinmag-video-hub__start">
      <div class="theinmag-video-hub__start-inner">
        <div class="theinmag-video-hub__start-copy">
          <h2 class="theinmag-video-hub__start-heading">{{ section.settings.start_heading | default: 'New here? Start with this.' }}</h2>
          <p class="theinmag-video-hub__start-line">{{ sf[9] }}</p>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="theinmag-video-hub__start-player" data-start-video="{{ sf[1] }}" aria-label="Play: {{ sf[3] | escape }}">
          <img src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/{{ sf[1] }}/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360" loading="lazy" alt="">
          <span class="theinmag-video-hub__start-play" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 68 48" width="64" height="45" focusable="false"><rect width="68" height="48" rx="12" fill="#FF0000"/><path d="M27 15v18l16-9z" fill="#FFFFFF"/></svg></span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="theinmag-video-hub__searchband">
    <form class="theinmag-video-hub__search" role="search" onsubmit="return false;" id="videos">
      <label class="theinmag-video-hub__search-label" for="theinmag-video-search">{{ section.settings.search_label }}</label>
      <input
        id="theinmag-video-search"
        class="theinmag-video-hub__search-input"
        type="search"
        autocomplete="off"
        placeholder="{{ section.settings.search_placeholder | escape }}"
        aria-describedby="theinmag-video-search-status"
        data-video-search
      >
      <p id="theinmag-video-search-status" class="theinmag-video-hub__search-status" aria-live="polite" data-video-search-status></p>
      <ul class="theinmag-video-hub__results" data-video-results hidden></ul>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  (function () {
    var v = document.querySelector('[data-hero-video]');
    if (v) {
      var still = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      var phone = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(max-width: 749px)').matches;
      var src = phone ? v.getAttribute('data-src-mobile') : v.getAttribute('data-src');
      if (!still && src) {
        var pb = document.querySelector('[data-hero-pause]');
        v.addEventListener('playing', function () { v.classList.add('is-playing'); if (pb) pb.hidden = false; });
        if (pb) pb.addEventListener('click', function () {
          var lab = pb.querySelector('[data-hero-pause-label]');
          if (v.paused) { v.play(); pb.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'false'); lab.textContent = 'Pause background video'; }
          else { v.pause(); pb.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'true'); lab.textContent = 'Play background video'; }
        });
        v.src = src;
        var p = v.play();
        if (p && p.catch) p.catch(function () {});
      }
    }
    var b = document.querySelector('[data-start-video]');
    if (b) b.addEventListener('click', function () {
      var f = document.createElement('iframe');
      f.src = 'https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/' + encodeURIComponent(b.getAttribute('data-start-video')) + '?autoplay=1&rel=0&playsinline=1';
      f.title = b.getAttribute('aria-label').replace('Play: ', '');
      f.allow = 'autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture; fullscreen';
      f.setAttribute('allowfullscreen', '');
      f.className = 'theinmag-video-hub__start-iframe';
      b.replaceWith(f);
      f.focus();
    });
  })();
</script>

{%- comment -%} Search index: built from the same registry, so new videos and their keywords appear here with no extra work. {%- endcomment -%}
<script type="application/json" data-video-index>
[
  {%- assign first = true -%}
  {%- for rec in records -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign f = rec | split: '^^'
      assign live_ts = f[4] | date: '%s' | plus: 0
      if f[2] == 'picnic'
        assign sn = 'Picnic Planning'
      else
        assign sn = 'Field Notes'
      endif
      assign thumb = f[8] | append: '-640.jpg' | asset_url
      assign hh = f[0] | strip
      if f[2] == 'start'
        continue
      endif
    -%}
    {%- unless first -%},{%- endunless -%}{%- assign first = false -%}
    {"url": {{ '/pages/' | append: hh | json }}, "title": {{ f[3] | json }}, "show": {{ sn | json }}, "area": {{ f[14] | json }}, "minutes": {{ f[7] | json }}, "thumb": {{ thumb | json }}, "live": {{ live_ts }}, "out": {{ f[5] | split: ',' | first | split: ' (' | first | json }}, "kw": {{ f[3] | append: ' ' | append: sn | append: ' ' | append: f[14] | append: ' ' | append: f[9] | append: ' ' | append: f[15] | downcase | json }}}
  {%- endfor -%}
]
</script>

<script>
  (function () {
    var input = document.querySelector('[data-video-search]');
    var list = document.querySelector('[data-video-results]');
    var status = document.querySelector('[data-video-search-status]');
    var idxEl = document.querySelector('[data-video-index]');
    if (!input || !list || !idxEl) return;
    var videos = [];
    try { videos = JSON.parse(idxEl.textContent); } catch (e) { return; }
    var stop = ' a an and are as at be but by can do does for from get got how i in into is it its kid kids child children my me of on or our so the their them they this to too up we what when where which who why will with you your'.split(' ');
    function norm(s) { return (s || '').toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9' ]+/g, ' ').replace(/\s+/g, ' ').trim(); }
    videos.forEach(function (v) { v.hay = ' ' + norm(v.kw) + ' '; v.head = ' ' + norm(v.title + ' ' + v.show + ' ' + v.area) + ' '; });
    function esc(s) { return String(s).replace(/[&<>"]/g, function (c) { return { '&': '&amp;', '<': '&lt;', '>': '&gt;', '"': '&quot;' }[c]; }); }
    function run() {
      var q = norm(input.value);
      var words = q.split(' ').filter(function (w) { return w && stop.indexOf(w) === -1; });
      if (!q || !words.length) { list.hidden = true; list.innerHTML = ''; status.textContent = ''; return; }
      var now = Date.now() / 1000;
      var hits = videos.map(function (v) {
        var score = 0;
        words.forEach(function (w) {
          if (v.hay.indexOf(' ' + w) !== -1) score += 2 + (v.hay.split(' ' + w).length - 2) * 0.1;
          else if (w.length > 3 && v.hay.indexOf(w) !== -1) score += 1;
          if (v.head.indexOf(' ' + w) !== -1) score += 2;
        });
        if (v.hay.indexOf(' ' + q + ' ') !== -1 || v.hay.indexOf(q) !== -1) score += 3;
        return { v: v, s: score };
      }).filter(function (h) { return h.s > 0; }).sort(function (a, b) { return b.s - a.s; }).slice(0, 8);
      if (!hits.length) {
        list.hidden = true; list.innerHTML = '';
        status.textContent = 'Nothing yet for that. Try another word, like maths, calm or homeschool.';
        return;
      }
      status.textContent = hits.length === 1 ? '1 video matches' : hits.length + ' videos match';
      list.innerHTML = hits.map(function (h) {
        var v = h.v, soon = now < v.live;
        return '<li><a class="theinmag-video-hub__result" href="' + esc(v.url) + '">' +
          '<img src="' + esc(v.thumb) + '" width="96" height="54" alt="" loading="lazy">' +
          '<span class="theinmag-video-hub__result-text"><span class="theinmag-video-hub__result-meta">' + esc(v.show) + (v.area ? ' &middot; ' + esc(v.area) : '') + ' &middot; ' + (soon ? 'out ' + esc(v.out) : esc(v.minutes)) + '</span>' +
          '<span class="theinmag-video-hub__result-title">' + esc(v.title) + '</span></span></a></li>';
      }).join('');
      list.hidden = false;
    }
    input.addEventListener('input', run);
  })();
</script>

{%- if section.settings.popin_enabled -%}
<aside
  class="theinmag-video-hub__popin{% if section.settings.signature_font == 'ryanhand' %} theinmag-video-hub__popin--ryanhand{% endif %}"
  role="dialog"
  aria-modal="false"
  aria-labelledby="theinmag-video-popin-h"
  data-video-popin
  hidden
>
  <button type="button" class="theinmag-video-hub__popin-close" data-video-popin-close aria-label="Close">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 5l10 10M15 5L5 15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
  </button>
  <h2 id="theinmag-video-popin-h" class="theinmag-video-hub__popin-heading">{{ section.settings.popin_heading }}</h2>
  <p class="theinmag-video-hub__popin-body">{{ section.settings.popin_body }}</p>
  <p class="theinmag-video-hub__popin-sign">
    <span class="theinmag-video-hub__popin-name">{{ section.settings.popin_name }}</span>
    <span class="theinmag-video-hub__popin-role">{{ section.settings.popin_role }}</span>
  </p>
  <a class="theinmag-btn theinmag-btn--primary theinmag-video-hub__popin-cta" href="{{ section.settings.popin_url }}" data-video-popin-cta>{{ section.settings.popin_label }}</a>
</aside>
{%- if section.settings.signature_font == 'ryanhand' -%}
<style>
  @font-face { font-family: 'RyanHand'; src: url('{{ 'ryanhand-regular.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2'); font-display: swap; }
</style>
{%- endif -%}
<script>
  (function () {
    var KEY = 'theinmag_videos_popin_v1';
    var pop = document.querySelector('[data-video-popin]');
    if (!pop) return;
    try { if (window.localStorage.getItem(KEY)) return; } catch (e) {}
    var shown = false, lastFocus = null;
    function remember() { try { window.localStorage.setItem(KEY, String(Date.now())); } catch (e) {} }
    function show() {
      if (shown) return;
      shown = true;
      window.removeEventListener('scroll', onScroll);
      pop.hidden = false;
      setTimeout(function () { pop.classList.add('is-in'); }, 30);
      remember();
    }
    function hide() {
      pop.classList.remove('is-in');
      var hadFocus = pop.contains(document.activeElement);
      setTimeout(function () { pop.hidden = true; }, 320);
      if (hadFocus && lastFocus && lastFocus.focus) lastFocus.focus();
    }
    function onScroll() {
      var h = document.documentElement.scrollHeight - window.innerHeight;
      if (h > 0 && window.scrollY / h > 0.4) show();
    }
    document.addEventListener('focusin', function (e) { if (!pop.contains(e.target)) lastFocus = e.target; });
    pop.querySelector('[data-video-popin-close]').addEventListener('click', hide);
    pop.querySelector('[data-video-popin-cta]').addEventListener('click', remember);
    document.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) { if (e.key === 'Escape' && !pop.hidden) hide(); });
    window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });
    setTimeout(show, {{ section.settings.popin_delay | default: 12 | times: 1000 }});
  })();
</script>
{%- endif -%}

{%- liquid
  assign page_url = shop.url | append: request.path
-%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": {{ shop.url | json }} },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Videos", "item": {{ page_url | json }} }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "CollectionPage",
      "name": {{ section.settings.heading | strip_html | json }},
      "url": {{ page_url | json }},
      "description": "Free videos for teachers, parents and homeschoolers of kids 5-13: Picnic Planning lessons and Field Notes.",
      "publisher": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "theINmag", "url": {{ shop.url | json }} },
      "mainEntity": {
        "@type": "ItemList",
        "itemListElement": [
          {%- assign pos = 0 -%}
          {%- for rec in records -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign f = rec | split: '^^'
              assign live_ts = f[4] | date: '%s' | plus: 0
              if now_num < live_ts or f[2] == 'start'
                continue
              endif
              assign pos = pos | plus: 1
              assign item_handle = f[0] | strip
              assign item_url = shop.url | append: '/pages/' | append: item_handle
            -%}
            {%- if pos > 1 -%},{%- endif -%}
            { "@type": "ListItem", "position": {{ pos }}, "url": {{ item_url | json }}, "name": {{ f[3] | json }} }
          {%- endfor -%}
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
</script>

{% stylesheet %}
  .theinmag-video-hub { background: var(--color-cream); color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy); }

  /* ---------- full-bleed hero ---------- */
  .theinmag-video-hub__hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: clamp(560px, 86vh, 800px);
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
  }
  .theinmag-video-hub__media { position: absolute; inset: 0; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__image,
  .theinmag-video-hub__bgvideo {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .theinmag-video-hub__bgvideo { opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.6s ease; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__bgvideo.is-playing { opacity: 1; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__scrim {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(to top, rgba(20, 14, 30, 0.88) 0%, rgba(20, 14, 30, 0.72) 38%, rgba(20, 14, 30, 0.2) 70%, rgba(20, 14, 30, 0) 100%);
  }
  .theinmag-video-hub__copy {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 clamp(16px, 3vw, 32px) clamp(32px, 6vw, 72px);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
  }
  .theinmag-video-hub__eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .theinmag-video-hub__titlerow {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px 18px;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .theinmag-video-hub__heading {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5.4vw, 64px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 0;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }
  .theinmag-video-hub__sub {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 0 20px 0 16px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: #FFFFFF;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-shadow: none;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    transition: translate var(--transition-standard), box-shadow var(--transition-standard);
  }
  .theinmag-video-hub__sub-mark { display: block; flex: 0 0 auto; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__sub:hover { translate: 0 2px; box-shadow: 0 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); }
  .theinmag-video-hub__sub:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--color-yellow); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__line {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.7vw, 19px);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
  }
  .theinmag-video-hub__jumps { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__jumps .theinmag-btn { text-shadow: none; }
  /* WCAG 2.2.2: moving background video gets a pause control. */
  .theinmag-video-hub__pause {
    position: absolute;
    right: clamp(12px, 2vw, 24px);
    bottom: clamp(12px, 2vw, 24px);
    z-index: 2;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0 16px;
    border: 2px solid #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .theinmag-video-hub__pause[hidden] { display: none; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__pause:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--color-yellow); outline-offset: 3px; }

  /* ---------- start here ---------- */
  .theinmag-video-hub__start { padding: clamp(32px, 5vw, 56px) clamp(16px, 3vw, 32px) 0; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__start-inner {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .theinmag-video-hub__start-heading { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 40px); line-height: 1.1; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__start-line { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__start-player,
  .theinmag-video-hub__start-iframe {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    border: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(42, 31, 61, 0.22);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .theinmag-video-hub__start-player img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__start-play { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; translate: -50% -50%; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__start-player:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--color-inky-purple-navy); outline-offset: 3px; }
  @media (min-width: 990px) {
    .theinmag-video-hub .theinmag-video-hub__start-inner { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.4fr); gap: 48px; }
  }

  /* ---------- search ---------- */
  .theinmag-video-hub__searchband {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px) clamp(16px, 3vw, 32px) clamp(20px, 3vw, 32px);
  }
  .theinmag-video-hub__search { max-width: 640px; scroll-margin-top: 110px; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__search-label { display: block; font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__search-input {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 50px;
    padding: 10px 18px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    border-radius: var(--radius-button);
  }
  .theinmag-video-hub__search-input:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--color-yellow-shadow); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__search-status { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 14px; margin: 8px 0 0; min-height: 1.4em; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__results {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    padding: 6px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  }
  .theinmag-video-hub__result {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 8px;
    min-height: 44px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .theinmag-video-hub__result:hover,
  .theinmag-video-hub__result:focus-visible { background: var(--color-cream); outline: none; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__result:focus-visible { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px var(--color-inky-purple-navy); }
  .theinmag-video-hub__result img { flex: 0 0 96px; width: 96px; height: 54px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 8px; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__result-text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; min-width: 0; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__result-meta { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.8; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__result-title { font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.3; }

  /* ---------- join pop-in (not a modal) ---------- */
  .theinmag-video-hub__popin {
    position: fixed;
    left: 16px;
    right: 16px;
    bottom: 16px;
    z-index: 40;
    max-width: 360px;
    padding: 22px 22px 22px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-modal);
    transform: translateX(calc(-100% - 32px));
    transition: transform 0.32s ease;
  }
  .theinmag-video-hub__popin.is-in { transform: translateX(0); }
  .theinmag-video-hub__popin[hidden] { display: none; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__popin-close {
    position: absolute;
    top: 6px;
    right: 6px;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    cursor: pointer;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
  }
  .theinmag-video-hub__popin-close:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--color-inky-purple-navy); outline-offset: -3px; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__popin-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0 36px 8px 0;
  }
  .theinmag-video-hub__popin-body { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__popin-sign { margin: 0 0 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__popin-name {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 30px;
    line-height: 1;
    display: inline-block;
    rotate: -4deg;
    transform-origin: left center;
  }
  .theinmag-video-hub__popin--ryanhand .theinmag-video-hub__popin-name { font-family: 'RyanHand', var(--font-heading); font-size: 34px; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__popin-role { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 6px; }
  .theinmag-video-hub__popin-cta { width: 100%; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .theinmag-video-hub__popin { transition: none; transform: none; }
  }
  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .theinmag-video-hub .theinmag-video-hub__popin { left: 24px; right: auto; bottom: 24px; width: 360px; }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

